ACCESSORYACCESSD(8)         System Manager's Manual        ACCESSORYACCESSD(8)

NAME
     accessoryaccessd – Accessory exclusive access management

DESCRIPTION
     The accessoryaccessd daemon is responsible for managing exclusive access
     to accessories on behalf of users.

     accessoryaccessd is launched on-demand by launchd(8) and must not be
     invoked directly. Interaction with accessoryaccessd is done via the
     AccessoryAccess framework.

